# stor98.mpd / stor98.sys import allowlist - the DLL!function pairs the Stor98
# images built from src\stor98 may import, one "<target> DLL!function" per
# line, target win9x (stor98.mpd), x86 or amd64 (stor98.sys). Read by
# scripts\check-stor98-build.ps1, which scripts\build-driver.cmd runs on every
# Stor98 image it builds (roadmap-usb4 task 42-A.30). The format is this
# file's own, not xhci98-imports.allow's: no evidence tags and no target
# reading, since Stor98 is a ScsiPort miniport with its own provenance
# (src\stor98\AGENTS.md). A new import fails the gate until it is added here,
# which is the point: it is a reviewed change. Listed from the build of
# 2026-10-19 (src\stor98 at the 42-A.20 snapshot); against Stor98 0.4.0.0 the
# build dropped ScsiPortConvertUlongToPhysicalAddress and the NT images added
# the MmSystemRangeStart data import (the link-state receiver's address
# check, src\stor98\src\cmlinknt.c).
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetBusData
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetDeviceBase
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetPhysicalAddress
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetUncachedExtension
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortInitialize
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortNotification
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortReadRegisterUlong
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortSetBusDataByOffset
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortStallExecution
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortValidateRange
win9x SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortWriteRegisterUlong
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ExCreateCallback
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ExNotifyCallback
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!MmIsAddressValid
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!MmSystemRangeStart
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ObfDereferenceObject
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ZwClose
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ZwOpenKey
x86 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ZwSetValueKey
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetBusData
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetDeviceBase
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetPhysicalAddress
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetUncachedExtension
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortInitialize
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortNotification
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortReadRegisterUlong
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortSetBusDataByOffset
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortStallExecution
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortValidateRange
x86 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortWriteRegisterUlong
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ExCreateCallback
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ExNotifyCallback
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!KeBugCheckEx
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!MmIsAddressValid
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!MmSystemRangeStart
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ObfDereferenceObject
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ZwClose
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ZwOpenKey
amd64 NTOSKRNL.EXE!ZwSetValueKey
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetBusData
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetDeviceBase
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetPhysicalAddress
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortGetUncachedExtension
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortInitialize
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortNotification
amd64 SCSIPORT.SYS!ScsiPortSetBusDataByOffset
